          "text": "47",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghang'eat Yosefu gawa gwarukusa Farao gideaba, “Bwaabwa ea orjooga giyeanya nupkaana Ganaani nea gweadu nooga nyaawa ea dugwa ea haleanjeeda sean mideawa; ak ghamneawa gwanda ng'eanyiida Gosheni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gageanu orju muut aba jeeda orjooga ghaamwat ak ghwaat madeeda Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha orjooga geenyea Yosefu, “Gadiyeedeang'wa naaha?” Ghwalamda saawa ak gwayeesha Farao, “Soomjoagaagu fuga dugwa, geewuurjeewi ghweanigaasa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha saawa Farao, “Aseasa geapkaanyi eepiidana ng'eang'i; aba gideaba manda nyeega dugwa soomjoagaagu; aba gideaba ning'waaniit geejeeda aba ng'eanyiida Ganaani; ak ghamneawa geemuscheey, nung' goobiida soomjoagaagu ng'eanyiida Gosheni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Farao Yosefu, “Gweanu ea orjooga giyeang'wa sukwa nupka headaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida Misri gwanda geatingaagu; iina gweanu ea orjooga geamadu ng'eanyiida heeda was shiidaneeda; nung' goobiida ng'eanyiida Gosheni; ama inali aba jeenyaawa fuga mideawa uurda, ghoanung' ghoah fuga jea ghoahaaghwa dugweasu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweadu Yosefu ghweandaanyi was Yakobo, ak ghwaat heeda Farao, ak ghoadaw Yakobo ghawooda Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Farao ak gwayeesha Yakobo, “Ang'iing'i gibeahi gweanyeew hada?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yakobo Farao, “Gweanyeekeasu bea neayeeda ea bughala ea diktam ea damanamughuush; gweanyeeksu eang'ay aba jeeda eaweegeasu ak ghabwada hang'ooynata, ak ea mawuurji gweanyeeka saang'a bea gheambaghweanigeasu aba jeeda neayeeda nyaawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw Yakobo ghawooda Farao, amang'ata ghabeawa madeeda Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung' Yosefu goopteada ghwaan ea orjooga ghaamwat, ak ghoadaw giliwas aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri, nea ghoadaw ng'eanyiida heeda was shiidaneeda, neekeewa mujiineeda Ramesi, gawuurji gidarukusiinda Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw Yosefu ghwaan hamita, ea orjooga ghaamwat, ea fuga sean bea gheanyaawa, ea diibiga manang'i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Geejeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat geejeeda ng'waan ak ea manda booga jeeda ng'eanyiida; ak ghwaak jalooda fuga ng'eanyiida Misri ea fuga Ganaani ea gwasawana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu ghoawaam Yosefu lapiyeesean mida jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri ea ng'eanyiida Ganaani, aba booga shaayda; ak gweadu Yosefu lapiya jeeda gheeh Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyi bwak ama niduulean lapiyeesean aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri ea ng'eanyiida Ganaani, ghapka buuneesean bea ng'eanyiida Misri heeda Yosefu ak gwayeesha, “Gooneasa hamita; ghwasaan inyas gajeemeewiisiina madeeda gheanyangaagu? Aba gideaba lapiyeedeanya niisha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Yosefu ak gwayeesha, “Agoona dugweagwa, ak gaydagooneegwa hamita nea geayamujeewi dugweagwa, iiniisha lapiyeedeang'wa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweadu dugwa nyaawa heeda Yosefu; ak ghoadaw Yosefu hamita nea gooyamuuji faraasajeega, ea nooga, ea dugwa, ea digeeniga: ak ghoadaw saawa hamita nea gooyamuuji dugwa nyaawa sean aba gweaydida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea ning'ata gweaydida, gabiigu headaanyi gweayda bassa, ak gwayeesha niny, “Aseasa mwajeafunyaneey huumeanda siida haw, gideaba lapiyeedeanya niisha; nea dugwaasa ea niba siideanya haw, ak ea mudugwanda gichea eegoona geaghus sasanuukaasa ea ng'eanyiideanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasaan inyas gajeemeewiisiina madeeda gheanyangaagu, aseasa ak geang'amnyi ng'eanyiideanya? Shaaheasa aseasa ea ng'eanyiideanya ak gigoanyeasa hamita, ak geahuuyi soomjooga Farao ak gageanda ng'eanyiideanya; ak gigoonyeasa booga ak abeeda geaghuyi ea meemeewi, ak geehisti madameagaasa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwasha Yosefu ng'eanyiisean bea Misri ak ghoadaw Farao; aba gideaba fuga Misri nishaayda ng'eanyiida nyaawa, aba gideaba ning'waaniit geejeeda. Ak gaba ng'eanyiida Farao; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghwanung' Yosefu ghoah buuneeda giing'oonyanga aba ng'eanyiida Misri ghang'eada murdeeda ng'eanyiida meatkweeni ea gagul meatkweeda niirja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida measha ng'eanyiida ashoohoodiga; aba gideaba iissa ghwanyas hamita adawi Farao, ak ea miighwashaayda ng'eanyiida nyaawa aba booga adawi Farao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yosefu buuneeda, “Ang'ula, askweareani naashaayeagwa agooga ea ng'eanyiideang'wa aba badayda Farao. Asi sukwa histeangeagwa, jea ahisana madameegeagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea damanda lajita gajoatayda gheamughuushcheanjagi aba jeeda gea amuut oatawa Farao, nea Gheamughuushcheeka asang'wan gayghoah geagwa, ak ghoah histeanga madameega nea ghoah hamiteang'wa ea dea fuga gealgeagwa, nea ghoah hamita diibigeagwa manang'i.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwalamda saawa ak gwayeesha, “Ang'iing'i niighuuhi eaweagaasa; asi siida haw gajeahuuwa giing'oonyanga Farao.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin Yosefu deaweeda aba jeeda ng'eanyiida Misri, ak ea gudugwanda ea ghoah ghamneawa, gideaba iissa Farao gajeataw gheamughuushcheandeaba muut; geaghus ng'eanyiida ashoohoodiga heeda maba Farao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidahuuydean gasa Yakobo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobiida Israeli ng'eanyiida Misri, jeeda ng'eanyiida Gosheni; ak ghwanyas haleanjeeda aba ng'eanyiita, ak gwaji ea ghwasaang'ayiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.47.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.47.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 47:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
