        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea gwaneekiit damanda jea ghameawa Israeli, gaguursa orjeedaanyi was Yosefu ak gwayeesha, “Iibwariinyaan, giyiini geatindaang'u jeeda riirdeanyu, ak geeheeleesi aba habeawooda huumwa gideaba, adibung'sean ng'eanyiida Misri, ",
          "type": "text",
