        {
          "text": "geagasayi eebung'sean heeda mida ghweanigeasu; sareanaan ak giiruuteawean ng'eanyiida Misri ak gibung'sean ng'eanyiida sibung'sa saawa.” Ghwalamda niny ak gwayeesha, “Gaydasinda gidinyaashti.” ",
